{"id":"hurry-curry","name":"Hurry Curry!","tagline":"Multiplayer co-op coooking game","blurb":"Hurry Curry! is a cooperative multiplayer game about cooking.","description":"Hurry Curry! is a cooperative multiplayer game about cooking. You work at a restaurant accepting orders, cooking various dishes and serving meals to customers. But don’t take too long, as customers might get impatient.\n\nCustomers enter your restaurant and order various meals. Your task is to assemble these meals by cutting, cooking, baking, searing and combining resources in the kitchen. Multitasking is crucial, but can lead to food burning or customers leaving if you take too long. There are many different restaurant/kitchen layouts to choose from.","developer":"The Hurry Curry! contributors","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/icons/128x128/org.metamuffin.hurrycurry.client.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-1_1248x702@1.png","w":1920,"h":1080},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-2_1248x702@1.png","w":1920,"h":1080},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-3_1248x702@1.png","w":1920,"h":1080},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/metamuffin/hurrycurry.client/c9702da32dcbcd4b13fd3575b64444ce/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org